      "text": "Proxy_b7e1 was exploited on 24 November 2024 on BNB Chain due to a logic flaw in its proxy contract, resulting in losses around $8,500. The attacker manipulated order creation and execution, siphoning funds from the vulnerable contract. A proxy contract order-execution logic allowed an attacker to craft and execute orders with manipulated parameters, bypassing intended limitations. The contract relied on insufficient validation of inputs, permitting extraction of USDT from the contract."
